--
--   This is `NLogN.KFY.axBndBN` from xuanji's $\kappa = 2^{-182}$ formalization (statement and proof unchanged apart from the constants) with the constants of §8 replaced by those of the community patch `same-network-129`: $\tau = 1 - 2^{-42}$ (same swap networks, motif exponent from $\log 10^6 < 14$), $\varepsilon = c = 2^{-43}$, $\lambda' = 1 - 2^{-85}$ ($\delta = 1/16$ unchanged). The parameter map $d = \lfloor b^{\varepsilon} \rfloor$, $K = \lfloor d^{c} \rfloor$, $\ell = \lceil L/d \rceil$, $\alpha = \lceil (12 d^2 b)^{1/4} \rceil$, $r = 2^{\ell}$ is the one of `Def_IntMul_OpenAI_R129`, and every constant-dependent name lives under `IntMul.OpenAI.R129.P`.
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFY 17: the numeric parameters of the passes*.
